只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH plugin by PiedPiper911 — dsh-workflow-canvas","id":"gh:1337173256","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-workflow-canvas","slug":"PiedPiper911/dsh-workflow-canvas","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH plugin by PiedPiper911 — dsh-workflow-canvas"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-workflow-canvas 🧭"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Visual workflow builder for DeepSeek Harness (DSH).\nDrag and drop nodes to orchestrate **tool calls,"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" sub-agents, and conditional branches** into a workflow that runs through DSH's `ctx.workflows` engi"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ne. Powered by React Flow (xyflow) and Zustand."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Node types"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Node | What it does |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| ▶ Trigger | Workflow entry point (a prompt). |\n| ⚙ Tool | A single tool call (e.g. `video_frames`,"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" `bash`). |\n| 🤖 Agent | Delegate a step to a sub-agent with its own prompt. |\n| ◇ Condition | Branch"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" on an expression (then/else edges). |\n| ✓ Output | Terminal result template. |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"1. Build a graph on the canvas: drag nodes from the toolbar, connect them with edges.\n2. The store c"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ompiles the graph into an **ordered step list** (breadth-first from triggers, conditions become bran"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ches) — this is the exact shape DSH's workflow engine consumes.\n3. `Run` hands the steps to `ctx.wor"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"kflows`; `Export` saves a `.workflow.json` you can reload later."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The data model is deliberately transport-agnostic: the canvas is a *view* over a plain-JSON workflow"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" spec, so it composes with any DSH workflow provider."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
